// Article 1. Members and capital.
Fact person Identified by Iris, Jonah, Kemal
Role company Is Tidewater
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Fact member Identified by person
Function capital Identified by person * int
Amount total-capital : Int Is Sum(Foreach capital: capital.int)
Var cash : USD

Power call-capital Actor company Recipient person Related to usd
  Holds when True
  Void when True

Clause 1.1 Definition => company, member(Iris), member(Jonah), member(Kemal)
Clause 1.2/1 Definition => capital(Iris, 50000), capital(Jonah, 30000), capital(Kemal, 20000)
Clause 1.2/2 => call-capital
Clause 1.3 Definition => total-capital.
